{{Quote|So happy to have you here on the Colossus.|Rolt, to several First Order stormtroopers|<ref name="The First Order Occupation" />}}
'''Rolt''' was a [[Gotal]] [[Gender|male]] who lived on the ''[[Colossus]]'', and a regular of [[Z'Vk'Thkrkza|Aunt Z's]] [[Aunt Z's Tavern|tavern]]. When the [[First Order]] [[Occupation of the Colossus|occupied]] the ''Colossus'', Rolt was initially happy with their presence, but was later arrested and taken away by several stormtroopers for loitering past curfew.

==Biography==
{{Quote|Let me go! I didn't do nothing! I got my rights!''"<br />"''Quiet! You're under arrest for loitering past curfew.|Rolt and a First Order stormtrooper|<ref name="The First Order Occupation" />}}
Rolt was a resident of the ''[[Colossus]]'',<ref name="The First Order Occupation" /> a [[Fuel|refueling]] station on the [[planet]] [[Castilon]].<ref name="Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> [[Gender|He]] regularly attended the [[Aunt Z's Tavern|tavern]] owned by [[Z'Vk'Thkrkza|Aunt Z]].<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|rolt|Rolt}}</ref>

After the [[First Order]] organized the [[Torra Doza's abduction|kidnapping]] of [[Torra Doza]] to get the station's [[captain]], [[Imanuel Doza]], to allow their presence as security on the ''Colossus'',<ref name="The Doza Dilemma">{{Resistance|The Doza Dilemma}}</ref> Rolt was welcoming of the [[Occupation of the Colossus|occupation]]. In the [[Colossus marketplace|marketplace]], Rolt walked past a [[Unidentified First Order stormtrooper commander|stormtrooper commander]] with several other [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]], calling out to them. The [[commander]], however, walked away without acknowledging the [[Gotal]], and one of the stormtroopers pushed past him, knocking Rolt aside. Soon after, while the stormtroopers questioned [[Glem]] for not having his identification, Rolt was chatting with [[Opeepit]], the ''Collosus''{{'s}} janitor.<ref name="The First Order Occupation" />

Later in the [[Standard day|day]], Rolt was captured by a pair of stormtroopers, who tied his [[Limb|hands]] behind his back and arrested him, claiming he had been loitering past curfew. Despite his attempts to claim innocence and protest his rights, Rolt was taken away by the stormtroopers, watched from around the corner by [[Kazuda Xiono]] and [[BB-8]].<ref name="The First Order Occupation" />

==Behind the scenes==
Rolt first appeared in the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' episode "[[The First Order Occupation]]," voiced by [[Jason Hightower]].<ref name="The First Order Occupation" />

